  "purpose": [
    "Route Nigerian complaints through appropriate domestic, diplomatic, regional and international mechanisms",
    "Separate non-binding advocacy from formal judicial or human-rights procedures",
    "Prevent ordinary complaints from being misrouted to the International Criminal Court",
    "Preserve admissibility and domestic-remedy requirements",
    "Prevent mass emailing, guessed contacts and misuse of international institutions"
